## SQ-FCK-07 | glow lichen in a 9x9-chunk plains box about 3x the control boot (c3_b2.qb, SQ-FCK-07c); no lichen codec error
@group A
@commands Fresh world, pregen a 9x9 chunk area around 0,0 in a plains / forest seed; count `minecraft:glow_lichen` blocks (`tools/farm_worldgen_probe.js` block census or WorldEdit `//count`); same on a control boot with the two `kubejs/data/minecraft/worldgen/*/glow_lichen.json` files moved out
@pass about 3x the control count or more; no `glow_lichen` codec error in latest.log (FL-15)
@fails JSON codec error (1.19.2 IntProvider shape); a mod's biome lists a different lichen feature
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1113/c3_b1.qb
bootreject glow_lichen.*([Cc]odec|[Ee]rror|Failed)|Failed to parse.*glow_lichen
> locate biome minecraft:plains
waitlog nearest minecraft:plains is at|Could not find 300
capture PL minecraft:plains is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {PL1-72} {PL3-72} {PL1+71} {PL3+71}
sleep 90
# a count box is at most 262144 blocks (64x64x64): the box runs as slices; the shell prints the summed n per block
