> cdevtest count {PL1-72} -64 {PL3-72} {PL1+71} 70 {PL3-61} minecraft:glow_lichen
> cdevtest count {PL1-72} -64 {PL3-60} {PL1+71} 70 {PL3-49} minecraft:glow_lichen
